<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Engelhard cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it cut Engelhard Corp to a near-term neutral from its prior rating of buy. The stock is still considered a long-term buy, Merrill said.</p>
<p>-- Engelhard shares closed at 23-3/8 on Tuesday. They were indicated lower, at 20 to 22, ahead of the opening of trade on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst John Roberts was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
